# Demo session 1 (headless; approvals fail closed). Agents are named @role#n.
# 1. Start Tsuna with fixture configuration (done by the launcher) and ask for a survey.
Survey the repository and check its working tree.
/sleep 400
# 2-3. Two specialists were dispatched; inspect status while they run.
/agents
# 4. Steer the explorer while it is still running.
/steer @explore#1 Also look at the docs folder.
# 5. Receive structured results (the orchestrator collects them with `wait`).
/wait 30
/agents
/read @explore#1 4
/read @tester#1 2
# 6. Give the completed explorer a follow-up in the same session.
/followup @explore#1 Now list the test files.
/wait 30
/read @explore#1 2
# 7. Park it (session disposed; revivable from transcript + contract).
/park @explore#1
/agents
/mcp
/quit
